  "description": "They say you always meet your worst enemies at military reserve training. When Yong-Taek runs into Wu-Chang in the training center’s restroom, he tries to offer a sincere apology for their messy high school past. But Wu-Chang hasn't changed a bit, throwing insults and mocking Yong-Taek’s family until something finally snaps. Yong-Taek decides it’s time for a different kind of \"discipline.\" He never hated Wu-Chang; he just realized that sometimes, the only way to show love is through a very firm, very hard lesson.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
